      "role": "cite",
      "name": "habeas:coverage",
      "commentary": "TermLike requires this callback on the unit-test-only adapter.\n The fixed-width display tests request no horizontal cursor movement,\n so this no-op has no application behavior to test. Real terminal\n movement remains exercised through the PTY integration test."
